</strong>: Train, level up, and defeat ranked fighters to dominate the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Storyline</strong>: Discover the truth behind your father\u2019s fall and Dana\u2019s betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Erotic Content</strong>: Build sexual tension and unleash it across branching scenes with major female characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Business &amp; Money</strong>: Run Leza\u2019s shop, manage brothels, and make money from sex, fame, or fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Choices</strong>: Your decisions impact relationships, sex paths, loyalty, and power plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harem Progression</strong>: Turn your apartment into a den of loyalty, lust, or love\u2014with Anna, Nisha, and Aniya all living under one roof.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In MMA Life Simulator, strength alone isn\u2019t enough\u2014<strong>control is everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["BNS7"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/header.jpg?t=1752647041","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256999661,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256999661/movie480.mp4?t=1750663245","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256999661/mo